00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:42,720
 to need a polymer to intune these fibers to make up the bulk FRP. Layup of FRPs almost always

76
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:47,520
 involves using a thermosetting resin as the polymer. And the reason that we use thermosetting

77
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:52,400
 resins as opposed to thermoplastics is largely a question of manufacturing convenience. Before

78
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:56,160
 and in the early stages of the curing process, thermosetting resins are a viscous liquid which

