00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:05,440
 serendipitous because thermosets generally have the kind of properties that we'd want to use in a

81
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:09,360
 an FRP. They're a little bit stronger and a little bit stiffer and a little bit more temperature

