00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:14,080
 resistant than their thermoplastic cousins. For this purpose, amongst all thermosetting resins,

83
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:18,400
 polyester and vinyl ester resins are probably the most common. Polyester, for example, has been

