00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:10,080
 between the resin you're putting on for your part and the polystyrene you'd like to use in your

95
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:14,160
 form. On a somewhat related note, polyester and vinyl ester resins can also be a little bit

96
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:19,120
 dangerous to work with. The MEKP catalysts that you use to kickstart the curing process is pretty

