00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:23,920
 toxic to humans. A slightly safer option for both the humans working with the resin and the

98
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:28,480
 forms that you might be using is epoxy resin. Epoxy resins are generally a little bit more bio

